                                "sense_id": "51990498-bedd-3074-ba8d-106d97f2929a",
                                "text": "Except the cyclostomes, as the lampreys and sphagobranchiæ, which are not real fishes, as I shall show elsewhere."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cab9bd8-e8f5-4253-afd6-f1622b546ae9",
                                "sense_id": "51990498-bedd-3074-ba8d-106d97f2929a",
                                "text": "The Cyclostomes, or suckers, with regard to their skeletons, are the most imperfect of all the Vertebrates,"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
